# 27. Evidence Classification Rules

Registry evidence uses the following classifications.

## IMPLEMENTED

The capability exists in the NICAI implementation.

## OBSERVED

The capability has been observed during runtime execution.

## VERIFIED

Direct evidence confirms the capability and its expected behaviour.

## EXTERNAL

The capability belongs to an external system.

## REQUIRES EXTERNAL CONTRACT

The capability cannot be certified until the canonical external contract is supplied.

## PENDING

Required evidence has not yet been produced.

## NOT YET CERTIFIED

Implementation or integration preparation may exist, but independent certification has not occurred.

